      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.066,
          "end": 5.033,
          "en": "Tutor: State is actually not a React specific concept",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.033,
          "end": 8.033,
          "en": "but it is a key concept in React as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.033,
          "end": 9.766,
          "en": "And here in ExpenseItem,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.766,
          "end": 12.6,
          "en": "we have a scenario where we wanna use",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.6,
          "end": 15.333,
          "en": "that built-in state concept.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.333,
          "end": 15.633,
          "en": "that built-in state concept.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 15.633,
          "end": 17.233,
          "en": "Because this title here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 17.233,
          "end": 20.166,
          "en": "which changes when the clickHandler executes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 20.166,
          "end": 23.866,
          "en": "is actually data that should result",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 23.866,
          "end": 27.233,
          "en": "in this component being re-evaluated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 27.233,
          "end": 27.433,
          "en": "in this component being re-evaluated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 27.433,
          "end": 31.366,
          "en": "and re-drawn on the screen when it's changes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 31.366,
          "end": 34.6,
          "en": "when that's title data changes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 34.6,
          "end": 38.533,
          "en": "And by default, regular variables like this one,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 38.533,
          "end": 43.266,
          "en": "are not triggering such a re-evaluation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 43.266,
          "end": 43.433,
          "en": "are not triggering such a re-evaluation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 43.433,
          "end": 45.6,
          "en": "React doesn't care about that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 45.6,
          "end": 48.5,
          "en": "If you have a variable in your component function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 48.5,
          "end": 52.733,
          "en": "and the that variable changes, React ignores it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 52.733,
          "end": 52.766,
          "en": "and the that variable changes, React ignores it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 52.766,
          "end": 56.3,
          "en": "It doesn't care about that, that code executes, sure,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 56.3,
          "end": 59.633,
          "en": "but the overall component function doesn't execute again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 59.633,
          "end": 62.566,
          "en": "just because some variable changed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 62.566,
          "end": 65.93299999999999,
          "en": "And as a side note, even if it would execute again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 65.93299999999999,
          "end": 68.166,
          "en": "of course then title, this variable,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 68.166,
          "end": 70.2,
          "en": "would all just be retreated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 70.2,
          "end": 73.066,
          "en": "and re initialized to the props value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 73.066,
          "end": 75.4,
          "en": "Because as part of this component function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 75.4,
          "end": 78.4,
          "en": "we are creating this title variable.",
